    "notes": "Ivan Mazepa was Hetman of the Cossack Hetmanate from 1687 until his break with Peter I in 1708. The user label 'Zaporozhia' is normalized to the Cossack Hetmanate, the polity he actually governed; he was not the ruler of the Zaporozhian Sich."
